# __TITLE__

Generated with `create-tixkit-app` using SvelteKit and `@tixkit/sveltekit`.

Copy `.env.local.example` to `.env.local`, configure local credentials, then run:

```bash
bun install
bun run typecheck
bun run dev
```

The generated app includes a browser-safe widget, a server-side checkout form action, and a verified webhook endpoint. Replace the demo brand, event, and ticket type identifiers before use.
